# Sales Performance Dashboard using Power BI

## Project Overview

This project presents an interactive Sales Performance Dashboard built using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard helps analyze sales, profit, customer segments, product categories, and regional performance.

## Objectives

- Analyze overall sales performance
- Identify profitable categories
- Compare regional sales
- Track monthly sales trends
- Discover top-performing products

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel
- DAX
- Data Visualization

## Dashboard Features

- KPI Cards
  - Total Sales
  - Total Profit
  - Total Orders

- Monthly Sales Trend

- Category-wise Sales

- Region-wise Sales

- Top 10 Products

- Customer Segment Analysis

- Interactive Filters (Region, Category, Segment)

## Key Insights

### 1. West Region generated the highest sales revenue.

### 2. Technology category contributed the highest profit.

### 3. Sales reached their highest level during November and December.

